WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.667
Decide what would count as a pass before you run the test.

00:00:03.667 --> 00:00:08.625
Define the task, the pass rule, and what you will revise if the test fails.

00:00:08.625 --> 00:00:13.542
Sample rule: four out of five people find the booking link within twenty seconds.

00:00:13.542 --> 00:00:18.792
Write your pass rule before collecting results. Check that you could score it today.
